{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Candy☆Boy","Twin sisters, Yukino and Kanade Sakurai, room together in the dorms at their high school, enjoying school life with their friends and one another. One day, Sakuya Kamiyama, an underclassman, seeks out Yukino, while Kanade learns from a friend that Sakuya has admired Yukino for a very long time.  This innocent revelation sets into motion a chain of events that eventually lead to Yukino expressing her feelings for her sister."],"ja":["Candy☆Boy",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":3456,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":6479,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-4535","ids":{"shikimori":4535,"mal":4535,"anilist":4535,"kodik":"serial-6354"},"kodikIds":["serial-6354"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-6354":"2019-12-06T12:39:58Z"},"title":"Кэнди-Бой","originalTitle":"Candy Boy","alt":"Candy☆Boy","description":"] Юкино и Канадэ Сакураи живут в одной комнате в общежитии при школе, наслаждаясь насыщенной порой жизни, юностью, вместе с друзьями. Однажды Юкино встречает Сакую Камияму , ученицу на год младше, а Канадэ в это время узнаёт от друзей, что новая знакомая её сестры уже давно восхищается последней. Это, казалось бы, невинное откровение приводит к цепи событий, которые помогают сёстрам понять свои чувства друг к другу.","year":2008,"type":"ONA","genres":["седзе ай","юри","любовный многоуголник","Школа"],"rating":6.76,"popularity":17295,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[3456,6479],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4535-5BgYPK9MfJaR.png","width":460,"height":690},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4535-uu4fECgP6Qk2.jpg","width":1900,"height":399}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":0,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","provide